                        kind @decision
                        text "Promoted ahead of the other P3 nodes on measured evidence. After ronin-eval-scratch-buffers cut command-evaluation allocations 33%, wall time against C samurai moved only 1.65x to 1.58x. Allocation is therefore no longer the binding constraint in evaluation; every binding still resolves through String-keyed BTreeMaps, so each lookup is a byte-wise comparison through pointer-chasing tree nodes. Interning names to integer symbols targets that directly, where ronin-edge-metadata-cache and ronin-memchr-scanner would each shave further allocations the measurements say are no longer dominant. Priority pinned to 0 so the computed frontier reflects this."
                    }

