                        text "The workspace figure in this node's completion note is one short, and so is the same figure in the notes on make-empty-variable-name-does-not-abandon and make-grouped-tests-need-the-make-feature, which were written from the same measurement.\n\nAll three say \"workspace 894 passed / 0 failed\". The correct figure at c2e2bcf is 895 passed / 0 failed. The 894 run was taken before conformance caught the missing written-line seed; the fifth kati unit test that correction added — `a_prefix_written_before_an_expansion_belongs_to_the_whole_expansion` — was not in the tree when the count was read, and the notes were written afterwards without re-reading it. kati's lib suite is 213 tests, not 212; every other target's count in the two runs is identical.\n\n889 baseline plus four kati unit tests plus `loud_expanded_line_keeps_the_command` plus `make_tests_declare_the_make_feature` is 895. No test failed in either run, and no other gate figure in those notes moved."
