                        at 2026-08-23T10:24:22.063368519Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @errata
                        text "Count correction on the completion note above. The matrix is FOURTEEN cells, not fifteen. Counted off the note's own table: WHOSE VERDICT THE DEPENDENT READS is six, WHICH VARIABLES is two, BESIDE IT is six.\n\nThe rest of the arithmetic holds: six cells were fixed here — the four under WHOSE VERDICT marked FIXED and both under WHICH VARIABLES — and the other eight agreed before and after, five of them as controls that were already gated."
                        after_done true
