                kind @note
                text "GATES on the fixed tree. `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, `scripts/check-lints.sh` and `RUSTDOCFLAGS=-D warnings cargo doc --no-deps` clean, no new warnings — `prepare_graph` crossed the hundred-line lint on the first attempt and the loop was written tighter rather than the lint waived.\n\n    cargo test --all-targets --no-fail-fast             895 / 0   (893 + the two added)\n    cargo test --workspace --all-targets --no-fail-fast 1211 / 0  (1209 + two)\n\n    Make equivalence   274 makefiles, 276 graphs, 8 respellings, 56 make-rejected,\n                       0 disagreements — TWENTY runs, every column identical on all\n                       twenty, `one_graph_however_many_threads_read_it` with each\n    Make conformance   354 runs against GNU Make 4.4.1; 276 identical raw,\n                       326 identical normalised, 28 differing\n    Upstream           18 unclassified / 0 compiler / 15 interface\n    Port ledger        170 symbols\n    Ninja conformance  425 / 425 upstream, 10 differential, 92 build-outcome,\n                       3 invocation-boundary; persistence round trip, log content\n\nEvery count is the reference it was told to hold, and the two that moved moved by exactly the two tests added."
